{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A cozy idle creature-collector that keeps growing while you rest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a magical forest filled with adorable little monsters. Hatch eggs, raise pals from <strong>common</strong>\u00a0to <strong>rare</strong>\u00a0and watch them <strong>evolve</strong> as you feed them, keep them happy, and care for their health. Expand a gentle <strong>farm</strong>\u00a0and a tiny <strong>forest hotel</strong>, set up smart <strong>automations</strong>, then relax. Your valley keeps earning coins even when the game is minimized or your PC is off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/a67a783e5ac813cb30582c26573b3189.poster.avif?t=1772937725\" width=360 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/a67a783e5ac813cb30582c26573b3189.webm?t=1772937725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Productive and relaxing, at the same time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in <strong>Pomodoro productivity timer</strong>\u00a0helps you focus in short bursts while your pals do the work. Use the optional <strong>transparent window mode\u00a0</strong>to keep the cozy forest in view without covering your desktop. Play for a minute, get back to work, come back to new surprises, micro-stress free.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise &amp; Evolve</strong> \u2013 feed, play, and care for happiness/health to unlock charming evolutions from common to rare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/b233438d062f92c6354776dba3879649.poster.avif?t=1772937725\" width=360 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/b233438d062f92c6354776dba3879649.webm?t=1772937725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eggs &amp; Collection\u00a0</strong>\u2013 hatch adorable pet, and collect them all.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/f499a8721cf930bc2ef7a79b33688dbc.poster.avif?t=1772937725\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/f499a8721cf930bc2ef7a79b33688dbc.webm?t=1772937725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm &amp; Forest Hotel</strong> \u2013 plant and harvest foods, host guests and collect all the gift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/9d1b21995c5682e7a342a7f53e3ba64c.poster.avif?t=1772937725\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/9d1b21995c5682e7a342a7f53e3ba64c.webm?t=1772937725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Screen &amp; Pets</strong> -\u00a0The game screen and all pets are fully scalable, so you can resize them to fit your setup and comfort.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/bd31d654bd72b96cbf48cb2c584aae8b.poster.avif?t=1772937725\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/bd31d654bd72b96cbf48cb2c584aae8b.webm?t=1772937725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pomodoro + Transparent Window</strong> \u2013 focus timer, gentle chimes, and an optional see-through game window for productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/1fef88572a05f4f467405b7b7b5b2d3d.poster.avif?t=1772937725\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/1fef88572a05f4f467405b7b7b5b2d3d.webm?t=1772937725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/2a164ab7e6b5057057d1637687f2751d.poster.avif?t=1772937725\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/2a164ab7e6b5057057d1637687f2751d.webm?t=1772937725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Aesthetics</strong>\u00a0 \u2013 pastel palette, day\u2013night cycle, soft ambience, fireflies, and sparkles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/801cb3bfb3d6b1bf0cf99e96dfde0ec6.poster.avif?t=1772937725\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/extras/801cb3bfb3d6b1bf0cf99e96dfde0ec6.webm?t=1772937725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play at your pace </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a laid-back, aesthetic idle game perfect for quick check-ins or long, cozy sessions. No harsh deadlines, no fear of missing out. Just cute monsters, gentle progress, and a forest that feels alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fair by design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pay-to-win. Golden tickets and special items are earned through play. We want the loop to feel satisfying, not exhausting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now</strong> to follow updates, new pals, seasonal events, and fresh decorations for your valley!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4146150?t=1772937725","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/e75a39bdc3a0e81d315e68dc4c38ba9a927ddb89/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772937725","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/77696b4dad1c781441ef57d43b82e6e33ed81934/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772937725","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/77696b4dad1c781441ef57d43b82e6e33ed81934/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772937725","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4421530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A cozy idle creature-collector that keeps growing while you rest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a magical forest filled with adorable little monsters. Hatch eggs, raise pals from <strong>common</strong>\u00a0to <strong>rare</strong>\u00a0and watch them <strong>evolve</strong> as you feed them, keep them happy, and care for their health. Expand a gentle <strong>farm</strong>\u00a0and