"bb_tag\" >Fair by design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pay-to-win. Golden tickets and special items are earned through play. We want the loop to feel satisfying, not exhausting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now</strong> to follow updates, new pals, seasonal events, and fresh decorations for your valley!</p>","developers":["Script Smelter Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146150/0398644649c871f31ff4084a9da704c7c74f8199/header.jpg?t=1772937725","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Script Smelter Studios. \u201cPetal Pals\u201d and the Script Smelter Studios name and logos are trademarks of PT. Maulana International Technologies. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nUses the Unity engine. Unity is a trademark of Unity Technologies. All other trademarks are the property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4146150/164914710/bcf9144e6beeacccbf7a264ec51cf13c8035d82c/1772152308/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772153097","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4146150/164914710/bcf9144e6beeacccbf7a264ec51cf13c8035d82c/1772152308/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772153097","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4146150/164914710/bcf9144e6beeacccbf7a264ec51cf13c8035d82c/1772152308/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772153097","id":257224438,"name":"Petal Pals : Pre-Release Gameplay Overview (Trailer 1)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257224438/76f84477b4